OL,3,GNEWSA'Complete chaos' as car park
OL,4,Acloses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure of a Surrey car park is
OL,7,Fcausing "complete chaos", according to
OL,8,Fa councillor.
OL,10,FOxted station car park was shut after
OL,11,Fdamage to its ceiling was found on
OL,12,FWednesday evening.
OL,14,FIn a letter seen by the BBC, Tandridge
OL,15,FDistrict councillor Cameron McIntosh
OL,16,Fsaid the closure of the 366-space site
OL,17,Fhad resulted in a "significant" loss of
OL,18,Fparking provision for commuters, rail
OL,19,Fusers and visitors to the town centre.
OL,21,FSouthern Rail has apologised to all
OL,22,Fthose affected.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
